{title: Half Moon Alter}
{artist: Sunny Davidson}

Wakantanka we call to you
Round the half moon alter of red and blue
Sending an arrow that's straight and true
To the heart of the fire with this prayer to you (rpt)

Help us to bring your spirit through
Healing and purification too
Guide us in everything we do
For the sake of the seven generations (rpt)

Pachamama we call to you...
Tabacito we call to you...
Peyotito we call to you...
